{"id":281,"date":"2024-10-19T02:38:11","date_gmt":"2024-10-19T02:38:11","guid":{"rendered":"https:\/\/westaucklandstorage.co.nz\/?p=281"},"modified":"2024-10-22T03:39:32","modified_gmt":"2024-10-22T03:39:32","slug":"west-auckland-storage-your-go-to-for-secure-boat-and-vehicle-storage","status":"publish","type":"post","link":"https:\/\/westaucklandstorage.co.nz\/west-auckland-storage-your-go-to-for-secure-boat-and-vehicle-storage\/","title":{"rendered":"West Auckland Storage: Your Go-To for Secure Boat and Vehicle Storage"},"content":{"rendered":"\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\"><strong>Overview<\/strong><br>West Auckland Storage offers a comprehensive range of secure storage solutions for boats, caravans, motorbikes, and more. With flexible options for short-term and long-term storage, we provide a safe and convenient environment for your valuable vehicles and belongings.<\/p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\"><strong>Key Services<\/strong><\/p>\n\n\n\n<ul class=\"wp-block-list\">\n<li><strong>Boat Storage<\/strong>: Ideal for fishing boats, sailing vessels, and jet skis. Our secure hardstand space keeps your watercraft safe from the elements and theft.<\/li>\n\n\n\n<li><strong>Caravan Storage<\/strong>: Clear your driveway or garage with our spacious and secure caravan storage options. We accommodate various sizes, from camper vans to motorhomes.<\/li>\n\n\n\n<li><strong>Motorbike Storage<\/strong>: Protect your motorcycle from the weather and potential vandalism with our dedicated motorbike storage units.<\/li>\n\n\n\n<li><strong>Business Storage<\/strong>: Keep your office clutter-free with our commercial storage solutions, perfect for paperwork, inventory, and equipment.<\/li>\n<\/ul>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\"><strong>Benefits of Choosing West Auckland Storage<\/strong><\/p>\n\n\n\n<ul class=\"wp-block-list\">\n<li><strong>Secure Facility<\/strong>: 24\/7 monitored security with a resident manager on-site ensures peace of mind.<\/li>\n\n\n\n<li><strong>Flexible Leasing Options<\/strong>: Month-to-month leases for short-term needs or discounted rates for long-term storage.<\/li>\n\n\n\n<li><strong>Convenient Access<\/strong>: Drive directly to your storage unit for easy loading and unloading.<\/li>\n\n\n\n<li><strong>Affordability<\/strong>: Competitive pricing that won\u2019t break the bank.<\/li>\n<\/ul>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\"><strong>Contact Us<\/strong><br>For more information or to get a quote, call us at <strong>09-818 4586<\/strong> or email <strong><a>info@westaucklandstorage.co.nz<\/a><\/strong>. Visit us today to discover how we can meet your storage needs!<\/p>\n","protected":false},"excerpt":{"rendered":"<p>OverviewWest Auckland Storage offers a comprehensive range of secure storage solutions for boats, caravans, motorbikes, and more. With flexible options [&hellip;]<\/p>\n","protected":false},"author":1,"featured_media":282,"comment_status":"open","ping_status":"open","sticky":false,"template":"","format":"standard","meta":{"rank_math_lock_modified_date":false,"_uag_custom_page_level_css":"","site-sidebar-layout":"default","site-content-layout":"","ast-site-content-layout":"","site-content-style":"default","site-sidebar-style":"default","ast-global-header-display":"","ast-banner-title-visibility":"","ast-main-header-display":"","ast-hfb-above-header-display":"","ast-hfb-below-header-display":"","ast-hfb-mobile-header-display":"","site-post-title":"","ast-breadcrumbs-content":"","ast-featured-img":"","footer-sml-layout":"","theme-transparent-header-meta":"","adv-header-id-meta":"","stick-header-meta":"","header-above-stick-meta":"","header-main-stick-meta":"","header-below-stick-meta":"","astra-migrate-meta-layouts":"default","ast-page-background-enabled":"default","ast-page-background-meta":{"desktop":{"background-color":"var(--ast-global-color-4)","background-image":"","background-repeat":"repeat","background-position":"center center","background-size":"auto","background-atta